      "part_type": "Hadith",
      "path": "/books/al-kafi:3:4:85:11",
      "text": [
        " كَانَ أَبُو جَعْفَرٍ ( عليه السلام ) يَقْضِي عِشْرِينَ وَتْراً فِي لَيْلَةٍ ."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.hubeali": [
          "Ali, from his father, from Ibn Al-Mugheira, from Abu Jareer Al-Qummy, ",
          "(It has been narrated) from Abu Abdullah<sup>asws</sup> having said: ‘It was so that Abu Ja’far<sup>asws</sup> had fulfilled twenty <span class=\"iTxt\">Witr</span> (<span class=\"iTxt\">Salāts</span>) in one night’."
        ],
        "en.sarwar": [
          "11. Ali has narrated from his father from ibn al-Mughirah from abu Jarir al-Qummiy who has said the following: “Abu ‘Abd Allah, ‘Alayhi al-Salam, has said, ‘Abu Ja‘far would perform the Qada’ (compensatory prayer) twenty al-Witr in one night.’” "
        ]
      }
